  "横向对照 12 个法域的法律层级结构与法源类型，帮助使用者判断某一条文是否具有直接适用效力、是否需要辅以判例或宗教法核查。": "Horizontally compare the legal hierarchy structures and source-of-law types of the 12 jurisdictions, helping users judge whether a provision has direct applicable effect and whether case law or religious law needs to be checked as well.",
