  "用自然语言描述您的跨境法律问题，我会在数据库中检索相关法条，并给出带溯源的答案。例如：外商投资准入、劳动用工、数据合规、知识产权保护、合同与争端解决。": "Describe your cross-border legal question in natural language; I will search the database for the relevant provisions and give an answer with citations. For example: foreign investment market access, labour and employment, data compliance, intellectual property protection, contracts and dispute resolution.",
  "用自然语言提问，例如：越南外资企业的最低注册资本要求是什么？": "Ask in natural language, for example: what is the minimum registered capital requirement for a foreign-invested enterprise in Viet Nam?",
