  "融合法律知识图谱、检索增强生成与多语种自然语言处理，实现条文级解析、比对与术语即时翻译。": "Integrating a legal knowledge graph, retrieval-augmented generation and multilingual natural language processing to deliver provision-level parsing, comparison and instant terminology translation.",
  "被引用情况": "Citations",
  "裁判主要依据成文法典与法律条文。检索时应优先定位法律条文，并核对其是否被政令、部门规章细化；条文的适用效力以最新生效版本为准。": "Judgments are based mainly on codified statutes and statutory provisions. When searching, priority should be given to locating the statutory provisions and checking whether they are elaborated in decrees or ministerial rules; the applicability of a provision is determined by the latest version in force.",
  "覆盖": "Coverage",
  "覆盖东盟11国 · 多语种 · AI智能检索": "Covering 11 ASEAN countries · multilingual · AI-powered intelligent search",
  "覆盖中文、英文及东盟主要语种，支持以本国语言检索与阅读，并提供跨语言条款比对。": "Covering Chinese, English and the main ASEAN languages, with support for searching and reading in one's own language and for cross-lingual clause comparison.",
  "覆盖跨境高频法律领域，按主题聚合各国相关法规，支持跨法域横向对比。": "Covering high-frequency cross-border legal areas, aggregating relevant laws of each country by subject and supporting horizontal comparison across jurisdictions.",
