  "语料库口径：东盟法律行业语料库已汇聚 7 种语言、10 万余部法规、超 5 亿字；已完成百余部重点法规翻译，形成 300 余万字平行语料。": "Corpus scope: the ASEAN legal industry corpus has gathered 7 languages, more than 100,000 laws and regulations and over 500 million characters; translation of more than one hundred key laws has been completed, forming a parallel corpus of over 3 million characters.",
