  "适用于穆斯林当事人的特定事项": "Applies to specific matters involving Muslim parties",
  "选取 2–3 个法域的条文，系统自动对齐“适用范围 / 核心概念定义 / 法律后果 / 程序与期限 / 门槛与标准”五个维度，生成差异比对报告并给出制度衔接提示。": "Select provisions from 2–3 jurisdictions and the system automatically aligns five dimensions — \"scope of application / core concept definition / legal consequences / procedure and time limits / thresholds and standards\" — generating a difference comparison report and institutional alignment notes.",
  "选取 2–3 国条文自动生成四维差异比对报告与制度衔接提示": "Select provisions from 2–3 countries to automatically generate a four-dimension difference comparison report and institutional alignment notes",
