  "面向东盟十一国与中国共十二个法域的法律法规检索平台，提供法规与条约检索、法律体系对照、跨语言条款比对、法律术语对照与基于检索增强生成的智能问答，为跨境法律实务、合规审查与比较法研究提供数据支持。": "A legal research platform covering eleven ASEAN member states and China — twelve jurisdictions in total. It offers legislation and treaty search, legal-system comparison, cross-lingual clause comparison, multilingual legal terminology and retrieval-augmented AI answers, supporting cross-border legal practice, compliance review and comparative research.",
  "按名称、文号、关键词检索，支持按国家、主题、法律层级、时效性、公布日期、施行日期、制定机关与语言筛选。": "Search by title, document number or keyword, with filters for jurisdiction, topic, legal hierarchy, status, promulgation date, effective date, issuing authority and language.",
