  "12 个法域、三大法系，成文法与判例法并行的区域法律图景": "12 jurisdictions across three legal families, where codified statutes and case law operate side by side",
  "本数据库收录中国与东盟十国共十二个法域的官方法规文本，条文取自各国官方发布渠道，保留来源链接与入库日期，可逐条回访核验。": "This database covers the official legal texts of China and the ten ASEAN member states across twelve jurisdictions. Provisions are taken from official national publication channels, with source links and accession dates retained for article-by-article verification.",
  "按国家、主题、法律层级、时效性与制定机关筛选，定位中国与东盟各国法规。": "Filter by country, topic, legal hierarchy, validity and issuing body to locate laws across China and ASEAN.",
  "基于库内法条做检索增强问答，每条结论附条文出处，可逐条回溯原文。": "Retrieval-augmented Q&A grounded in the provisions in this database; every conclusion cites its source article and can be traced back to the original text.",
  "逐条标注官方来源、入库日期与收录形态，可回访官方页面核验。": "Every entry records its official source, accession date and coverage type, so each can be verified by revisiting the official page.",
  "本平台面向跨境投资与商事活动的法律查明需求，提供中国与东盟十国法律法规的多语种检索、跨语言条款比对与法律术语对照。我们只收录官方公开发布的法规文本，免费开放，无需注册登录。": "This platform serves legal research for cross-border investment and commercial activity, offering multilingual search, cross-language clause comparison and legal terminology mapping for the laws of China and the ten ASEAN member states. We include only officially published legal texts; the platform is free and requires no registration or login.",
  "每页条数": "Items per page",
  "法规文本取自各国官方法律信息门户与公开法律汇编，逐条标注官方来源、入库日期与收录形态，可回访官方页面核验。各国官方数据库与东盟条约官网链接见页面底部「友情链接」。": "Legal texts are drawn from official national legal portals and public compilations. Every entry records its official source, accession date and coverage type, so each can be verified by revisiting the official page. Links to national databases and ASEAN treaty websites are listed under \"Related Links\" at the foot of this page.",
  "多数国家的法律、法规及国家机关的决议、决定、命令等官方文件不属于著作权保护范围，但官方公报的版式、数据库编排及第三方译文可能受保护。本平台仅收录官方已公开发布的法规文本正文，不复制其版式与第三方译文；若权利人提出异议，我们将及时核实并处理。": "In most countries, laws, regulations and official acts of state organs are not protected by copyright, but the typography of official gazettes, database compilation and third-party translations may be. This platform includes only the officially published text of legal instruments and does not reproduce their typography or third-party translations. If a rights holder raises an objection, we will verify it and respond promptly.",
  "本平台免费开放，无需注册登录；如遇内容问题，欢迎通过页脚联系方式反馈。": "This platform is free and requires no registration or login. If you find a content issue, please let us know using the contact details in the footer.",
  "未检测到数据集：请确认 data 目录下的数据文件与本页面一同部署。": "No dataset detected: please make sure the data files under the data directory are deployed together with this page.",
  "筛选条件": "Filters",
  "筛选": "Filter",
  "支持按法规名称、文号或关键词检索，覆盖中国与东盟十国共十二个法域的官方法规文本；结果可按国家、主题、法律层级与时效性进一步筛选。": "Search by title, document number or keyword across the official legal texts of China and the ten ASEAN member states in twelve jurisdictions. Results can be narrowed by country, topic, legal hierarchy and validity.",
  "东盟成员国": "ASEAN Member States",
  "东盟十国与中国共同构成本库的十二个法域。下图按各国经纬位置示意其分布，点击任一国家可进入该国法律体系页。": "The ten ASEAN member states together with China make up the twelve jurisdictions in this database. The diagram below shows their distribution by latitude and longitude; select any country to open its legal system page.",
  "示意图：位置按各国经纬中心近似投影绘制，不代表实际边界与面积。": "Schematic: positions are plotted from each country's approximate geographic centre and do not represent actual borders or areas.",
  "东盟十国与中国共同构成本库的十二个法域。下图按真实经纬位置绘出各国疆域，点击任一国家可进入该国法律体系页。": "The ten ASEAN member states together with China make up the twelve jurisdictions in this database. The map below draws each country by its actual geographic position; select any country to open its legal system page.",
