  "如您通过页面所列联系方式与我们联系，我们仅在回复您的咨询所必需的范围内使用您提供的信息。": "If you contact us using the details listed on this page, we use the information you provide only as far as necessary to respond to your enquiry.",
  "对照十二个法域的法律层级结构与法源类型差异。": "Compare the hierarchy of legal norms and the types of legal sources across the twelve jurisdictions.",
  "平台提供人工智能辅助生成内容，该等内容可能存在偏差，用户应结合官方文本自行判断。": "The platform provides AI-assisted content, which may be biased; users should judge it against the official texts.",
  "抓取于": "Retrieved",
  "提示内容依据条约框架与制度差异自动生成，具体交易或争议应结合最新生效法律与个案事实判断。": "This note is generated automatically from the treaty framework and institutional differences. Specific transactions or disputes should be assessed against the latest law in force and the facts of the case.",
  "支持中文、英文与东盟主要语种的检索与阅读，并提供法律术语多语对照。": "Search and read in Chinese, English and major ASEAN languages, with multilingual legal terminology mapping.",
  "支持中文、英文及东盟主要语种的提问与检索；界面语言切换见顶部工具栏。当前语料以中文与英文为主，东盟语种原文通过跨语言召回定位后附原文对照。": "Ask and search in Chinese, English and major ASEAN languages; switch the interface language in the top toolbar. The current corpus is mainly Chinese and English, while ASEAN-language originals are located by cross-language retrieval and shown alongside.",
  "普通法系与混合法系国家需单列判例模块。本平台尚未收录该国判例，将通过各国最高法院官方渠道持续采集。": "Common law and mixed jurisdictions require a separate case-law module. This platform has not yet collected case law for this country and will continue collecting it through the official channels of its supreme court.",
  "暂未收录引用本法条的法规。": "No instruments citing this provision have been collected yet.",
  "未经许可，不得批量抓取、镜像、转售本平台数据，不得用于规避官方查询渠道的用途。": "Without permission, you may not bulk-scrape, mirror or resell this platform's data, nor use it to circumvent official enquiry channels.",
  "本平台不提供法律意见，不构成任何形式的委托代理关系。": "This platform does not provide legal advice and creates no attorney-client relationship of any kind.",
  "本平台不采集与法律法规检索无关的个人信息。": "This platform does not collect personal information unrelated to legal research.",
  "本平台提供的法规文本、译文、术语与检索结果仅供法律研究与实务参考，正式引用请以各国官方公布的文本为准。": "Legal texts, translations, terminology and search results on this platform are for legal research and practice reference only; for formal citation, rely on the texts officially published by each country.",
  "本平台法规文本来自各国官方法律信息门户与公开法律汇编，平台力求准确，但不排除存在录入或更新时差；正式引用请以官方公布文本为准。": "Legal texts on this platform come from official national legal portals and public compilations. We aim for accuracy but cannot rule out entry or update lag; for formal citation, rely on the officially published text.",
  "本法已修订，修订对照记录将随官方公报版本同步补充；当前展示的为最新生效版本文本。": "This law has been amended. Amendment comparison records will be added in step with the official gazette; the text shown is the latest version in force.",
  "条文取自官方法律数据库": "Provisions taken from an official legal database",
