  "安全提示：默认仅保存在本次会话，关闭标签页即失效；勾选“记住”才写入浏览器本地存储，请勿在公用电脑使用。API Key 只发送给您填写的接口地址，不经过本平台服务器，本平台也无法读取。": "Security: by default the Key is kept only for this session and is cleared when the tab closes. It is written to browser local storage only if you tick “Remember” — do not use on a shared computer. The API Key is sent only to the endpoint you enter; it never passes through this platform’s servers, which cannot read it.",
