  "已保存并启用模型增强": "Saved — model enhancement enabled",
  "“模型增强（自带 API Key）”为可选功能：由您自行向所选大模型服务商申请 API Key，并自行承担由此产生的 Token 费用；本平台不代收费用、不提供模型服务、不参与您与服务商之间的结算。": "\"Model enhancement (bring your own API Key)\" is an optional feature: you obtain an API Key from the LLM provider of your choice and bear the resulting Token costs yourself. This platform does not collect fees, does not provide model services, and is not a party to any settlement between you and the provider.",
  "启用该功能即表示您同意遵守所选服务商的服务条款与使用政策，并自行确认所在地区与服务商条款允许该等使用；因违反服务商条款产生的后果由您自行承担。": "By enabling this feature you agree to comply with the chosen provider’s terms of service and usage policies, and you are responsible for confirming that such use is permitted in your jurisdiction and under those terms. You bear the consequences of any breach of the provider’s terms.",
  "“模型增强”功能中，API Key 仅保存在您的浏览器（默认仅本次会话，关闭标签页即失效；您勾选“记住”后写入浏览器本地存储）。本平台无后端服务器，不接收、不存储、也无法读取您的 API Key。": "In the \"model enhancement\" feature, the API Key is stored only in your browser (by default for this session only, cleared when the tab closes; it is written to browser local storage only if you tick \"Remember\"). This platform has no backend server: it does not receive, store, or have any ability to read your API Key.",
  "启用该功能后，您的提问与经本地检索得到的条文材料会发送给您自行填写的接口地址（通常为您选定的大模型服务商）；该等数据在该服务商处的处理适用其隐私政策，请自行评估后使用。": "Once enabled, your question and the provision materials retrieved locally are sent to the endpoint you entered (typically your chosen LLM provider). Processing of that data at the provider is governed by its privacy policy; please assess it before use.",
  "除您填写的接口地址外，本平台不向任何第三方发送数据；本平台不具备采集使用记录的能力。": "Apart from the endpoint you enter, this platform sends data to no third party; it has no capability to collect usage records.",
  "“模型增强”模式下，答案由您自选的大模型生成，本平台不控制其内容，亦不对其准确性、完整性或适用性作出任何保证，不构成对模型输出的背书。": "Under \"model enhancement\" mode, the answer is generated by the LLM you selected. This platform does not control its content and gives no warranty as to its accuracy, completeness or fitness for purpose; nothing here endorses the model output.",
  "本平台会对模型输出执行引用校验并剔除无法回溯至本地条文的句子；校验不通过时自动降级为本地检索结果。该机制用于降低风险，但不等同于人工法律审阅。": "This platform runs a citation check on model output and removes sentences that cannot be traced back to provisions in the local database; if the check fails, it automatically falls back to local retrieval results. This mechanism reduces risk but is not equivalent to manual legal review.",
  "当前检索通道": "Current retrieval channel",
